alic>K </italic>= 5. a: Adenoviridae; b: Baculoviridae; c: Herpesviridae; d: Poxviridae. The unclassified dsDNA viruses are indicated by grey. Genus or subfamily names are placed close to the corresponding branches.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2148-7-41-2"/></fig></sec></back></article>